<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> fsharp\n\n:= new_disposable_test = mut 0i32\n\\ () =>\n    new_disposable \\ () => new_disposable_test <- *new_disposable_test + 1\n    |> \\ x => x : disposable ()\n    |> use\n    |> ignore\n    |> return\n|> async::new_task\n|> async::await_task\n|> async::run_synchronously\n*new_disposable_test |> _assert_eq 1","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
